From b5a1b13ddee578ddbd63cbeae0e85efdb8d80425 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:41:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] strings: the word between two formats of the playback mode
 notice

The notice of the playback mode joined a video's format and the one sent
with the English word "to" in every language. It is a string of Hades
now, "{0} to {1}" (core #62262, Estuary #54262; "de {0} a {1}" in
Spanish), passed to DescribePlaybackMode() by the announcer; a
translation that lacks either placeholder gives the English form. The
googletest of PlaybackMode.h has the cases.
---
